# Keep line endings from churning between machines. Git stores LF and
# hands Windows CRLF where it matters.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# The .iss needs its UTF-8 BOM: Inno Setup falls back to the system
# codepage without one, and the Cyrillic publisher name turns to mush.
*.iss text eol=crlf
*.ico binary
*.png binary
